sl ENGINE API usage" (Neal Gompa)\n- redhat: Conditionally disable libbpf_dynamic on &lt;F40 and &lt;EL9 (Neal Gompa)\n- redhat/configs: Enable the Android Binder IPC system for Hyperscale (Neal Gompa)\n- redhat/configs: Enable the Btrfs file system for Hyperscale (Neal Gompa)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Neal Gompa &lt;ngompa@centosproject.org&gt; [6.10.9-0.hs2]" date="1725969600">- redhat/kernel: disable perl support in perf for Hyperscale Facebook (Davide Cavalca)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Neal Gompa &lt;ngompa@centosproject.org&gt; [6.10.9-0.hs3]" date="1726056000">- redhat/kernel: fix macro infinite recursion issue (Davide Cavalca)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Neal Gompa &lt;ngompa@centosproject.org&gt; [6.10.9-0.hs4]" date="1726056001">- redhat/kernel: fix macro infinite recursion issue (take 2) (Davide Cavalca)</changelog>\n</package>\n')
